  <content>
  <section><para>When solving \(x^2−30x+26=0\) using the quadratic formula, Sloane's work showed the formula as this:</para>
<para>\(x=\frac{-30 \pm \sqrt {900-104}}{2}\).</para>
<para>Which of the following describes the error in her work?</para></section>
</content>
